error: [SemanticError GALA-E0049] $DIR/main.gala:7:21 `data` holds the result of `os.ReadFile(...)`, which can fail, so it is a `Try[[]byte]`; it cannot be indexed (hint: take the value with `.Get()` (panics on failure), `.GetOrElse(default)`, or `match { case Success(v) => ... case Failure(e) => ... }`; or bind the results Go-style: `val v, err = os.ReadFile(...)`)
